1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,618
Five things you must do in Tuvalu.

2
00:00:02,898 --> 00:00:04,565
The last one happens on a runway.

3
00:00:04,845 --> 00:00:09,028
1. Do bring Australian cash.
Cards are almost never accepted,

4
00:00:09,058 --> 00:00:12,136
and cash machines may
not take foreign cards.

5
00:00:12,416 --> 00:00:14,528
2. Do book your flight early.

6
00:00:14,558 --> 00:00:18,589
Fiji Airways flies to Funafuti
only a few times a week.

7
00:00:18,869 --> 00:00:21,440
3. Do snorkel the Funafuti
Conservation Area,

8
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:24,330
which protects about a
fifth of the lagoon's reef.

9
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,527
You need a guide and an official pass.

10
00:00:26,807 --> 00:00:28,212
4. Do watch a fatele,

11
00:00:28,242 --> 00:00:32,518
a dance song where each island
splits into two competing sides.

12
00:00:32,798 --> 00:00:37,480
5. Do join the evening games on the
runway, after the last plane has left.

